---
title: "Two cron runs and the ingest lease"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: busy
    lg1: idle
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 tan
  s0: No run active, lease free
  s1: One run updating the board, lease held
  s2: No run active, lease free, cron done
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the cron fires and takes the lease
  s1 --> s0: the run finishes and frees the lease or time passes
  s1 --> s2: time passes or the run finishes and frees the lease
  class s0 tan
  class s1 blue
  class s2 tan
